{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，S05仅停留18秒，却同时堆叠了多句叙述和大量感受词，阅读负担明显高于X，X在这一段更利落。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y最明显的优势是【】让普通观众不用读完所有文字，就能迅速抓住每段的心理重点；纵向话与感受交替，也让人物动机和音乐情绪更容易对应。水面、摇船、漂浮等意象反复回扣，配合按乐句出现的细节，使情绪从小心靠近、害怕失去到接受不确定性的变化更连贯，感受也更有层次。虽然局部存在信息过密的问题，但整体上Y更容易让人既看懂人物，又听见情绪的细微变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "def51b2d-e7a2-40ed-affc-1344fc02e6c7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T000657386826Z", "elapsed_seconds": 111.094, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:08:48.494554+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b1160d8e46760507240ee8b107ffd6a2719e204ba187a1b607c2ea87c9da8e96", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments